7. Split children inherit all four unresolved gaps without adding new AC coverage — split did not improve completeness

Additional context from prior review: The parent story SKY-006 is a coordination envelope whose value depends entirely on the quality of its split children. The split itself (into SKY-006-A and SKY-006-B) was performed by speckit against explicit coordinator routing that said 'No elaboration or split warranted' — this contradiction requires human confirmation before children are promoted. The parent's 3-AC envelope (both children must complete, review file must satisfy children's requirements, Verdict is authoritative) is internally

